UnitActionHub::constructor
└── when called by a child contract
    └── it sets the parent

UnitActionHub::isChild
├── when the actions builder is a child
│   └── it returns true
└── when the actions builder is not a child
    └── it returns false

UnitActionHub::_createNewActionsBuilder
└── When called
    ├── it creates a new actions builder
    ├── it marks the actions builder as a child
    └── it emits a NewActionsBuilderCreated event

UnitActionHub::hub
└── it returns true
